                    "<h3>Step 6: ask for the bill</h3>",
                    "<p>Use:</p>",
                    "<ul><li><strong>A conta, por favor.</strong></li><li><strong>Pode fechar a conta?</strong></li><li><strong>Posso pagar no cartão?</strong></li></ul>",
                    "<h3>Step 7: handle confusion</h3>",
                    "<p>Use:</p>",
